  {"question":"When is phase two, and what is the status of the partner integration in their studio software?","kind":"unknown","follow_up":"Partner team and rep: what does the partner need to deliver a live demo in Corelane's own setup, and by when?"}
 ],"rep_takeaway":"Two things won this deal and both are repeatable. First, put the customer's own data in front of the person who controls the money; Greg went from silent to signing because Tobi used their file, not our average. Second, ask 'whose signature does this need?' on day one. A champion saying 'it's my call' is not the same as owning the decision. Also, drop the global opener for regional subscription businesses and start with their failed renewals."},
